 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Use multiple methods simultaneously. A solid plan is the best deterrent, but bears are opportunistic and will take a free meal. Try to keep the food at least 100 yards away, and never right next to a tree or rock that looks like a hiding spot for them to surprise you. Stop all food for few days, and make sure everyone knows the plan. Keep all food in a bear can at night, and hang it high in the morning. Good, bears actually react well to your scary face. A simple wave in their direction usually stops them in their tracks.",
